+/* ---- Folio: fullscreen (night shift 2026-11-24) ----
+   Firefox hides its own sidebar and toolbars in fullscreen, but Folio's sidebar is its own element: a fullscreen video
+   (DOM fullscreen) stayed framed by the sidebar and the card's margins and rounded corners. Video fullscreen = page only.
+   F11 fullscreen with the toolbars slid away = sidebar hidden too (it comes back with the toolbars at the top edge). */
